  "evidence": {
    "scope": "Primary-text context and same-ID usage split; no base draft edits.",
    "rationaleJa": "JOS14:4以降の「ヨセフの子ら／家」は集団context。17:1–2でヨセフはマナセの父として個人名で言及され、24:32はヨセフ本人の骨と子孫の相続を同時に記す。既存同一IDを使い、個人用法と集団用法のprofile/source/factを分ける。",
    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "JOS 14:4 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS14.htm#V4",
        "text": "For the children of Joseph were two tribes, Manasseh and Ephraim. They gave no portion to the Levites in the land, except cities to dwell in, with their pasture lands for their livestock and for their property.",
        "textSHA256": "cdd53a69dac8387ab8000383ceca89f5b9f81614b18223af1d82ed960c5fd976",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 16:1 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS16.htm#V1",
        "text": "The lot came out for the children of Joseph from the Jordan at Jericho, at the waters of Jericho on the east, even the wilderness, going up from Jericho through the hill country to Bethel.",
        "textSHA256": "d99d0d9c4b24471731611805b1c02c2fe73b9577202a5aa6219d7af4823cf33b",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 16:4 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS16.htm#V4",
        "text": "The children of Joseph, Manasseh and Ephraim, took their inheritance.",
        "textSHA256": "7f004df4735e6deef6b383db4ad49232d7775cf9b591dc1ad97ed6fd67fdcf49",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:1 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V1",
        "text": "This was the lot for the tribe of Manasseh, for he was the firstborn of Joseph. As for Machir the firstborn of Manasseh, the father of Gilead, because he was a man of war, therefore he had Gilead and Bashan.",
        "textSHA256": "b49ff5730450d4133b2c2dcfe552c440ce8000a4b4eff10a3406dc41a6dc8d21",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:2 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V2",
        "text": "So this was for the rest of the children of Manasseh according to their families: for the children of Abiezer, for the children of Helek, for the children of Asriel, for the children of Shechem, for the children of Hepher, and for the children of Shemida. These were the male children of Manasseh the son of Joseph according to their families.",
        "textSHA256": "fc8c8e78d9293d3ca2e02fdf8db2d1b8f85e12d76d62c37247eabb9bb3ccfdbb",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:14 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V14",
        "text": "The children of Joseph spoke to Joshua, saying, “Why have you given me just one lot and one part for an inheritance, since we are a numerous people, because the LORD has blessed us so far?”",
        "textSHA256": "5b57222383e33fd9fcbfadda2b7f0b375f2b8178b5b05aa976a24b3c4dedae10",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:16 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V16",
        "text": "The children of Joseph said, “The hill country is not enough for us. All the Canaanites who dwell in the land of the valley have chariots of iron, both those who are in Beth Shean and its towns, and those who are in the valley of Jezreel.”",
        "textSHA256": "9e910082db5d0bebec5581f14172f15f4fe4acbfddaaf3810de5a02726030c18",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:17 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V17",
        "text": "Joshua spoke to the house of Joseph, that is, to Ephraim and to Manasseh, saying, “You are a numerous people, and have great power. You shall not have one lot only;",
        "textSHA256": "aa1a43475121ad092a821e9872c680304359aaa126a8c5b239d9aba19268e2ab",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:18 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V18",
        "text": "but the hill country shall be yours. Although it is a forest, you shall cut it down, and it’s farthest extent shall be yours; for you shall drive out the Canaanites, though they have chariots of iron, and though they are strong.”",
        "textSHA256": "aab99d07c17f60888e0a81253c9bb0aae9ac7bcb296329ffd216a6f6f6fd614a",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 18:5 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS18.htm#V5",
        "text": "They shall divide it into seven portions. Judah shall live in his borders on the south, and the house of Joseph shall live in their borders on the north.",
        "textSHA256": "5b1fcd45789808b79b1064e6ed4e1d240354e2afd8ff1b0548f35be68d92b25d",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 18:11 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS18.htm#V11",
        "text": "The lot of the tribe of the children of Benjamin came up according to their families. The border of their lot went out between the children of Judah and the children of Joseph.",
        "textSHA256": "09bfc249d75e33c1968e8a92f9ff58a5662bf5e9854f76b0bd37bfcf43487b58",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 24:32 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS24.htm#V32",
        "text": "They buried the bones of Joseph, which the children of Israel brought up out of Egypt, in Shechem, in the parcel of ground which Jacob bought from the sons of Hamor the father of Shechem for a hundred pieces of silver. They became the inheritance of the children of Joseph.",
        "textSHA256": "060ed7198ecd26b70cc272938e4491a85db889bf136c12a68c00b239229abf2c",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      }
    ],
